                            	  6650: tbl_A000_ppu_data:  ; orig: tbl_A000_ppu_data:
                            	  6651: 
                            	  6652: ; PPU buffer pointer table: 64 entries x 2 bytes = 128 bytes (NES little-endian 16-bit addresses)
                            	  6653: ; RAM entries (NES $0000-$07FF) resolve correctly via +$FF0000. ROM/bat stored verbatim.
